        "Line.46.Second.Image": "'He meets his equal' – (because) he is in the central position.",
        "Line.46.Third.Statement": "He separates himself from his associates. There will be no blame.",
        "Line.46.Third.Image": "'He separates himself from his associates' – (because) he cannot help (the ruler).",
